own WebDAV folder\n(kDrive, Nextcloud) if you like.\n\nAt first start you choose the engine: Google ML Kit (most reliable; closed code, needs\nGoogle Play services, sends usage statistics to Google, never your documents) or the free\nones (the app's own page finder and Tesseract). Black and white, text only.\n"}}, "versions": {"1a7a2438acc68ff69dd0e64305e0f8487a53302fb9acbf9b9b5da21afe498e2e": null, "82e4f9e0b68c351d2381d1041fcc622453297899299cf124f48ade02a5579960": {"added": 1790538343000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersScanner-v1.1.2.apk", "sha256": "82e4f9e0b68c351d2381d1041fcc622453297899299cf124f48ade02a5579960", "size": 40726724}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["arm64-v8a", "armeabi-v7a"], "versionName": "1.1.2", "versionCode": 7, "usesSdk": {"minSdkVersion": 26, "targetSdkVersion": 34}, "signer": {"sha256": ["b9c722e093f963ab7812922623e1c1a72fb9998537ad7d9aefa8b1a3f3a8120c"]}, "usesPermission": [{"name": "android.permission.CAMERA"}, {"name": "android.permission.INTERNET"}, {"name": "com.freedomfighter.readersscanner.DYNAMIC_RECEIVER_NOT_EXPORTED_PERMISSION"}, {"name": "android.permission.ACCESS_NETWORK_STATE"}]}, "antiFeatures": {"NonFreeDep": {"en-US": "If chosen at first start, Google ML Kit's document scanner runs through Google Play services."}, "Tracking": {"en-US": "Only with ML Kit chosen, Google's library sends usage statistics to Google (never the documents). The free engines send nothing."}, "UpstreamNonFree": {"en-US": "The app includes Google ML Kit (closed code), next to the free engines (Tesseract and its own page finder)."}}}}}, "com.freedomfighter.readerstasks": {"metadata": {"lastUpdated": 1790528146000}, "versions": {"29acf946f3d1887e133857a74769274e608f12870d3598cf52d87a346c4f3c7b": null, "8f51cbef525961140a2fe4c5c8da1941000321c1c333eed799a890d6c9fef594": {"added": 1790528146000, "file": {"name": "/ReadersTasks-v1.5.2.apk", "sha256": "8f51cbef525961140a2fe4c5c8da1941000321c1c333eed799a890d6c9fef594", "size": 5411406}, "manifest": {"nativecode": ["